The Appium server is already running on port 4723. Next, I'll create a session. Using curl with the W3C capabilities format:

POST /session
{
  "capabilities": {
    "alwaysMatch": {
      "platformName": "iOS",
      "appium:automationName": "XCUITest",
      "appium:udid": "D52A384B-2D91-405C-87D9-D703611D1353",
      "appium:bundleId": "xyz.blueskyweb.app",
      "appium:noReset": true,
      "appium:shouldTerminateApp": false,
      "appium:autoAcceptAlerts": false
    }
  }
}

Note: If you specify bundleId without an app path, the driver will launch the app (or attach to it). If noReset is true, it won't be reinstalled.

After that, accept the alert: POST /session/{id}/alert/accept.

